 order ties on distance, and routed this one was no worse.","Ring: 25.4 m of cable, 12 bends, 0 crossings, 0.0 m overlapping itself."],"H2":["Serves Bedroom 1: 22.2 of 100 m\u00b2, 1 of 5 nodes.","Living next door could join, but it's with H1: that zoning has the same hub count and less cable.","Stands in Bedroom 1, at least 0.5 m from walls: of 3550 allowed spots in its zone, this one gives the shortest ring. The most open spot, which a simple method would pick, adds 0.5 m.","Visits H2 \u2192 N1 Bedroom 1 \u2192 H2 (with this few nodes there is only one ring).","Ring: 0.3 m of cable, 2 bends, 0 crossings, 0.2 m overlapping itself."],"H3":["Serves Bedroom 2: 21.6 of 100 m\u00b2, 1 of 5 nodes.","Living next door could join, but it's with H1: that zoning has the same hub count and less cable.","Stands in Bedroom 2, at least 0.5 m from walls: of 3425 allowed spots in its zone, this one gives the shortest ring.","Visits H3 \u2192 N2 Bedroom 2 \u2192 H3 (with this few nodes there is only one ring).","Ring: 0.3 m of cable, 2 bends, 0 crossings, 0.2 m overlapping itself."],"H4":["Serves Bedroom 3: 21.6 of 100 m\u00b2, 1 of 5 nodes.","Living next door could join, but it's with H1: that zoning has the same hub count and less cable.","Stands in Bedroom 3, at least 0.5 m from walls: of 3238 allowed spots in its zone, this one gives the shortest ring. The most open spot, which a simple method would pick, adds 1.3 m.","Visits H4 \u2192 N3 Bedroom 3 \u2192 H4 (with this few nodes there is only one ring).","Ring: 0.3 m of cable, 2 bends, 0 crossings, 0.2 m overlapping itself."]},"hub_count":{"H":4,"by_area":2,"by_nodes":2,"alone":[]},"lower_bound":{"J":29.32,"gap_pct":22.6,"complete":true}}}